{
  "_comment": [
    "Valérian's music (the Hellfire Gaol's third gate, ZealotBoss.cpp), played by our own sound engine as music: the",
    "game's own music silent meanwhile. Each track played once from its phase's start: the fight is timed on it (p1: a",
    "pulse a second from 1.37 s; p2: 92.3 BPM from 1.39 s; plan: .agents/plans/gaol-third), and the server silences it",
    "as it ends - the engine would loop it (loopStart 0) past the track's own fade-out, never reached.",
    "His sounds (Valerian.*): Diablo IV's - Inarius's fight, the Paladin, Akarat's echo, a Knight caster, Mephisto's orb -",
    "picked by the user on the audition page (2026-10-11), each take whole (the bank's sub-bass stream mixed in), the two",
    "played at random. Levelled as the ear hears them (K-weighted, their loudest 0.4 s), then by what the user heard in",
    "the fight: the impacts 6 dB over the chains' first level, the warnings 3, the chain's sweep (five in a row) 6 under it. Past -4 dBFS (the limiter would only squash it) the rest is the sound's volume.",
    "Raised again after a pull (2026-10-12): the impacts 3 dB, the lances' thunder 6 dB, phase 2's music 5 dB.",
    "Valerian.FirstBlow: his first blow as a god (phase 2's hit), Akarat's echo's air-slam explosion, picked by the user.",
    "La Litanie's (picked 2026-10-12): its start (Inarius's ping), each spear raised (Inarius's throw), the litany complete (the Paladin's Holy Light), the profanation (Akarat's final possession).",
    "Valerian.VerseStrike: each spear on its verse, the Cataclysm's lightning bolt (picked 2026-10-12).",
    "Music.ValerianRewind: phase 3's, phase 2's own track again from just before its 1:11 drop (localTools/valerian/buildRewindMusic.py); Valerian.Rewind: the user's own sound (clockwork of a big clock, bells), time stopped and wound back as he refuses, the music cut (a wound back tape, then a lone bell, came first)."
  ],
